Fixed: StaggeredStokesFACPreconditionerStrategy::restrictResidual() with the
"RT0_COARSEN" velocity restriction method now fills the ghost cells of a copy of the
fine-level residual, from neighboring patches of that level and from homogeneous
physical boundary conditions, before restricting it. The FAC correction therefore no
longer depends on those ghost values of the right-hand side. Ghost cells next to
a coarse-fine interface are still read from the residual.
<br>
(Boyce Griffith, 2026/09/10)
